  "description": "From [Ramen Queens Scanlations](https://www.mangaupdates.com/groups.html?id=58685823800):\n\nDong Hui accidentally witnesses a girl who can control objects with her mind. The girl, wary of his presence, knocks him out. Dong Hui, fearful for his life, did something that would link their lives together. What happens when two extraordinary people meet?\n\nA story of two irregulars who became extraordinary.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5228181), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/55170135), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746013180), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/jaedam_sr_0126), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/5477), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=nkpf), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=w7tv)",
